ΔSearch — Algorithm Attribution

This software is an independent Python implementation of the algorithm
described in the paper:

    "Solving Subgraph Extraction Problems Using ΔSearch"
    by Rebin Silva Valan Arasu and Rajiv Gupta, UC Riverside
    arXiv:2606.13834

The implementation in this repository is by Sachin
(https://github.com/sachncs, sachncs@gmail.com) and is released under
the MIT License (see LICENSE).  The paper above is the source of the
underlying algorithmic idea; please cite it if you use this software
in research that builds on the published work.
